v.jpg"}, {"id": 1806698, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12q22.jpg"}, {"id": 1806692, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12q1w.jpg"}, {"id": 1806693, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12q1x.jpg"}, {"id": 1806694, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12q1y.jpg"}, {"id": 1806695, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12q1z.jpg"}, {"id": 1806696, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12q20.jpg"}, {"id": 1806697, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12q21.jpg"}], "slug": "castle-away", "summary": "The realm\u2019s surface is cursed by demons. While you are exploring, you discover some sort of crown. As you pick it up, the ground begins to tremble and the surface starts to rise. You find yourself on a massive, floating keep...\n\nCastle Away is a roguelite autobattle castle builder, where you scavenge for goods, slay monsters, and enhance your keep. Adapt your castle's layout to the materials you find and the enemies you face. Try a new build every run!\n\nFeatures:\n\nDeep Customisation: Find 50 different Structures with 3 upgrade tiers, 30 Banner types and 30 different Boons, all with unique rules to build killer synergies.\n\nChallenging Enemies: Face off against 20 Monsters and 5 massive Demon Bosses.\n\nEncounter Variety: Discover Shops, Henchmen, Shamans, Towns, Cities and more.\n\n5 Distinct Realms: Navigate through five worlds to find all Ancient Seals.\n\nRoguelike Replayability: Random encounters, multiple endings, and procedural loot ensure fresh runs.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/castle-away", "videos": [{"id": 179712, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "KgIJL8fOQV8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KgIJL8fOQV8", "title": "Castle Away Announcement Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/KgIJL8fOQV8/fhddefault.jpg"}]}